C: the gods put it there. some things are not for us | that wall is the gods saying enough
D: or it is keeping something out | walls go both ways | maybe the wall is there for whatever is on the other side
B: i pressed against it for a while. nothing pressed back | i waited there an hour, nothing came
C: you waited an hour at a wall in the sea | an hour, at a wall nobody can see, in the water
B: best hour i had all week | quietest hour i ever spent
?D: next time i bring a full group and we all push | i bet if a whole raid swims at it, it gives
A: so a wall, and nobody knows what is behind it | i am swimming out this weekend now, thanks

